// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`llms.txt > matches snapshot 1`] = `
"# Acme Store API

> Manage your Acme store.

This is the API reference generated from a Yaak workspace. Every page is available as Markdown by appending \`.md\` to its URL.

## Endpoints

- [Health check](https://docs.acme.dev/health-check.md): Returns ok when the API is up.

## Authentication

Obtain and refresh access tokens.

- [Authentication overview](https://docs.acme.dev/authentication.md)
- [Log in](https://docs.acme.dev/authentication/log-in.md): Exchange user credentials for an access token.
- [Refresh token](https://docs.acme.dev/authentication/refresh-token.md): Get a new access token using a refresh token (OAuth 2 style form body).

## Products

Products are the items sold in your store.

- [Products overview](https://docs.acme.dev/products.md)
- [List products](https://docs.acme.dev/products/list-products.md): Returns a paginated list of products, newest first.
- [Get a product](https://docs.acme.dev/products/get-a-product.md): Retrieve a single product by its id.
- [Create a product](https://docs.acme.dev/products/create-a-product.md): Create a new product.
- [Update a product](https://docs.acme.dev/products/update-a-product.md): Partially update a product.
- [Delete a product](https://docs.acme.dev/products/delete-a-product.md): Permanently delete a product.
- [Images](https://docs.acme.dev/products/images.md): Upload and manage product images.
  - [Upload an image](https://docs.acme.dev/products/images/upload-an-image.md): Upload a product image (PNG or JPEG, max 5 MB).

## Orders

Orders placed by customers.

- [Orders overview](https://docs.acme.dev/orders.md)
- [List orders](https://docs.acme.dev/orders/list-orders.md): List orders, optionally filtered by status.
- [Create an order](https://docs.acme.dev/orders/create-an-order.md): Place an order on behalf of a customer.
- [Export orders (XML)](https://docs.acme.dev/orders/export-orders-xml.md): Legacy XML export.

## GraphQL

A GraphQL endpoint is available for flexible queries.

- [GraphQL overview](https://docs.acme.dev/graphql.md)
- [Search products](https://docs.acme.dev/graphql/search-products.md): Full-text product search with GraphQL.

## Realtime

Streaming APIs over WebSockets and gRPC.

- [Realtime overview](https://docs.acme.dev/realtime.md)
- [Order updates](https://docs.acme.dev/realtime/order-updates.md): Subscribe to real-time order events.
- [Get stock level](https://docs.acme.dev/realtime/get-stock-level.md): Query live inventory via gRPC.

## Optional

- [Full documentation](https://docs.acme.dev/llms-full.txt): All endpoints in a single file
"
`;

exports[`request markdown > documents a request with examples 1`] = `
"# Upload an image

Section: Products › Images

\`\`\`
POST https://api.acme.dev/v1/products/prod_123/images
\`\`\`

Upload a product image (PNG or JPEG, max 5 MB).

## Authentication

Bearer Token — \`Authorization: Bearer <token>\` (inherited from workspace "Acme Store API")

## Path parameters

| Name | Value |
| --- | --- |
| \`id\` | \`prod_123\` |

## Headers

| Name | Value |
| --- | --- |
| \`Accept\` | \`application/json\` |
| \`User-Agent\` | \`acme-docs/1.0\` |

## Body

Content type: \`multipart/form-data\`

| Field | Value |
| --- | --- |
| \`alt\` | \`Side view\` |
| \`file\` | \`@./shoe.png\` |

## Examples

### cURL

\`\`\`bash
curl -X POST https://api.acme.dev/v1/products/prod_123/images \\
  -H 'Accept: application/json' \\
  -H 'User-Agent: acme-docs/1.0' \\
  -H 'Authorization: Bearer {{api_token}}' \\
  -F 'alt=Side view' \\
  -F 'file=@./shoe.png;type=image/png'
\`\`\`
"
`;
